{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一条粉色竖线旁的白色大号粗体长句，位置靠上、亮度和字号突出，首先吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他想起以前自然亲近的日子，重新感受到温暖，盼望以后还能有那样的相处。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、温暖、期待。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他后来逐渐决定把日子过好；仍然担心孤单、对未来有所怀疑；最终决定即使没有人靠近，也要好好生活，不再为了留住别人而委屈自己。这一层最终的释然和自我接纳不容易第一眼拿到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"四条白色大号粗体长句字号和亮度相近，形成多个主视线竞争点。\",\n    \"单块长句包含多层意思，需要读完整句才能准确把握。\",\n    \"核心情绪变化分散在四个大块中，从怀念、重新振作、担忧孤单到最终释然，需要拼接才能理解完整处境。\",\n    \"右上角阶段目录字号较小，第一眼不容易作为判断当前阶段的辅助线索。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "04905d01-5289-433f-82ac-590021fcd613", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T032928858910Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:29:56.082121+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0b49730a5f1b68c7a640eed4c3ac3f437d7b01ba202229e7eb1eb36250b0e2b6", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8e